PAGE EMCON
TITLE EMCON: radio silence
KIND topic
SCREENS EMCON
SEE MSG-OUTBOX RESENDS
BEGIN_TEXT
EMCON stops every transmission from this box. Messages stay queued and
held ones stay held; nothing is lost. Receiving goes on as normal.

Anything that asks to send now is refused while EMCON is on. Turn it off
and the queue goes in precedence order.
END
